          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For years, 7–10 days before menses, the patient experiences marked irritability, mood swings, and increased anxiety, feeling like she cannot cope. Symptoms resolve 2–3 days after bleeding starts; she feels mostly normal mid-cycle."
